0.79           : Soil water depletion factor for canopy expansion (p-exp) - Lower threshold
0.2            : Shape factor for water stress coefficient for canopy expansion (0.0 = straight line)
0.41           : Soil water depletion fraction for stomatal control (p - sto) - Upper threshold
4.9            : Shape factor for water stress coefficient for stomatal control (0.0 = straight line)
0.77           : Soil water depletion factor for canopy senescence (p - sen) - Upper threshold
5.8            : Shape factor for water stress coefficient for canopy senescence (0.0 = straight line)
60             : Sum(ETo) during dormant period to be exceeded before crop is permanently wilted
0.77           : Soil water depletion factor for pollination (p - pol) - Upper threshold
4              : Vol% for Anaerobiotic point (* (SAT - [vol%]) at which deficient aeration occurs *)
66             : Considered soil fertility stress for calibration of stress response (%)
