38             : Maximum air temperature above which pollination starts to fail (heat stress) (В°C)
12             : Minimum growing degrees required for full crop transpiration (В°C - day)
3              : Electrical Conductivity of soil saturation extract at which crop starts to be affected by soil salinity (dS/m)
26             : Electrical Conductivity of soil saturation extract at which crop can no longer grow (dS/m)
